  - educational measurement
  - psychometrics
  - Julia
abstract: >
  ExtendedRtIrtModeling.jl is a Julia package for joint modeling of 
  item responses and response times in educational and psychological 
  testing. It implements three major extensions to the RT-IRT framework: 
  (1) Pólya-Gamma Gibbs sampler for logistic RT-IRT models, 
  (2) Bayesian quantile regression for latent regression models, and 
  (3) Bayesian quantile regression for cross-relation models. The 
  package provides efficient Gibbs sampling algorithms and supports 
  both Julia and R interfaces.
